  <name>Penguin Pass</name>
  <summary>Indoor cycling on a smart trainer</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Penguin Pass is an indoor-cycling game for Linux. Pair a smart trainer
      over Bluetooth, ride a 5 km mountain loop, and open the ride in a
      browser on a TV on the same network.
    </p>
    <p>
      With no trainer connected, a simulated rider is driven from the
      keyboard or a game controller.
    </p>
  </description>
